# Phase 128: near-Earth objects on the sky map. Asks JPL for the close
# approaches and Horizons for their positions (the site is never sent),
# draws them, and follows one the way the map's FOLLOW button does.
# Every NEO is shown here (NeoMagLimit=30) so there is one to follow.
name    NEO map: fetch, draw, follow
timeout 300

rig     NeoMagLimit=30

expect 30  [SCENARIO] NEO
expect 120 close approaches within
expect 20  on the map (of
wait   2
shot   neo-map
press  MAP:FOLLOW FIRST NEO
expect 10  [NEO] Following
expect 10  Target: asking JPL Horizons for
# Its window may not be in the next 12 hours; either answer is a working
# path. Only no answer at all fails.
wait   15
absent 1   could not reach JPL Horizons
press  GOTO:FOLLOW
wait   3
